{"id":"C2a880f9d890ef3cb82a8","zh":"轮轨密贴模型","en":"tight contact model","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"文中以轮轨紧密接触约束表达车辆与轨道联系的模型。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于车辆—轨道动力学建模，以位移约束连接轮对与钢轨，表达轮轨间的运动联系。其处理忽略轮轨接触弹性压缩，不计入这部分变形造成的相对位移。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C2a880f9d890ef3cb82a8","zh":"轮轨密贴模型","en":"tight contact model","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"Hc820ca606fe1b62a8460","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 贺天龙等（2017）"}],"designations":[{"id":"Dfb24f08d9019912a3c3c","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"轮轨密贴模型"},{"id":"Dc59ebb3accdc817cc427","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"tight contact model"}],"sources":{"P108":{"id":"P108","title":"基于轮轨时变接触刚度的车辆−轨道系统垂向振动分析","authors":"贺天龙,陈宪麦,徐磊","year":"2017","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672−7207.2017.08.023","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"贺天龙等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-vehicle-track-system-vertical-vibration-analysis-based-on-wheel-rail-time-varying-contact-stiffness"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sff281699f75e8c0d7ef3","source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"The tight contact model between wheel and rail, which was popular in China was compared and analyzed.","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S61762257a406edc0bbe3","source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"The results show that analyzing dynamic response of the vehicle-track system at the tight contact model for the long and medium-wave irregularity of track is feasible.","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Saf55145b5c1b3003e0bc","source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"通过输入脉冲型短波及中、长波不平顺激励,计算系统的动力响应,验证本文模型的正确性,并与国内常用的轮轨密贴模型进行比较分析。","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sa19f59dc228913cc13e3","source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"研究结果表明:轮轨密贴模型在分析中、长波不平顺激励工况下的系统动力响应是可行的;但在短波不平顺激励工况下,轮轨之间的刚性处理方法将放大短波激励效应,车轮“跳轨”处理方法尚需改进。","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"Cb28665edbfb3e5bf6d3e","target_concept_id":"Cb28665edbfb3e5bf6d3e","target_zh":"短波不平顺","target_en":"short wavelength irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_concept_id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_zh":"动力响应","target_en":"dynamic responses","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cc0128d2a1ad28f121d26","target_concept_id":"Cc0128d2a1ad28f121d26","target_zh":"动力学响应","target_en":"dynamic response","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P108","title":"基于轮轨时变接触刚度的车辆−轨道系统垂向振动分析","authors":"贺天龙,陈宪麦,徐磊","year":"2017","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672−7207.2017.08.023","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"贺天龙等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-vehicle-track-system-vertical-vibration-analysis-based-on-wheel-rail-time-varying-contact-stiffness"}]}